* ░▀░▀░▀▀▀░▀░░░▀▀▀░░░░░░░░░▀▀▀░▀▀▀░▀░▀░▀░░░▀▀▀░▀▀▀
*/

configuration {
    font                       : "Maple Mono NF 14";
    show-icons                 : true;
    terminal                   : "alacritty";

    timeout {
        action                 : "kb-cancel";
        delay                  :  0;
    }
    filebrowser {
        directories-first      : true;
        sorting-method         : "name";
    }
}
